A New T-Shirt Starts a Big Argument

Elon Musk's company started selling a new T-shirt.

The T-shirt became popular on the internet.

But many people did not like the joke behind it.

They said it made fun of child labor.

Child labor means children working instead of going to school or living a normal childhood.

Many countries have laws against child labor.

People on social media criticized the product.

They said companies should be careful with jokes about serious problems.

The article says businesses should think about how people may understand their products and advertisements.

A joke that seems funny to some people may upset many others.

The discussion shows that public opinion can spread very quickly online.
